# WHERE on a FLOAT column (floats: bit-exact FLOAT values, see tools/fixturegen MakeFloatTable):
# DuckDB casts an integer or DECIMAL literal to FLOAT with its own rounding and compares in FLOAT;
# a literal it types as DOUBLE (an exponent, more than 38 digits) compares in DOUBLE.
# docs/sql-subset.md, "Binding"; plan::DuckDbFloatOf.

